        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AH-D9, Clawfoot Lever with Oval Floral Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape of the Clawfoot Lever paired with the ornate Oval Floral Rose brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Fusion Hardware made lever and rose set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AH-D9 Clawfoot Lever and Oval Floral Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Ornate Door Lever Fusion AH D9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clawfoot Lever With Oval Floral Rose, Fusion AH-D9",
                "description": "Clawfoot Lever with Oval Floral Rose Fusion AH D9 - The unique shape of the Clawfoot Lever paired with the ornate Oval Floral Rose brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Fusion Hardware made lever and rose set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in 3 finishes.",
